1
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,920
Our distinguished guest,

2
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,359
welcome, a very warm welcome.

3
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:57,920
I'm Xiao Chuan, the hotel manager.

4
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,640
It's an absolute honor

5
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,000
to have you stay at the Grand Plato Hotel.

6
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,519
On behalf of all our staff,

7
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:06,000
I extend our warmest welcome to you.

8
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,480
Hello, I'm An Da.

9
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,400
I'm the deputy director of housekeeping here.

10
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,319
Your room is all ready.

11
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:11,879
This way, please.

12
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:13,400
I don't like anyone walking ahead of me.

13
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:13,879
Hurry, move!

14
00:02:13,879 --> 00:02:15,400
This is Antilocaris.

15
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:17,280
If you don't keep a clear line of sight,

16
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,080
you could be ambushed at any moment.

17
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,080
Right, of course.

18
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:22,919
If there's anything at all you need,

19
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:24,319
please don't hesitate to let us know.

20
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:25,840
We'll do everything we can to arrange it.

21
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:26,280
Get back here.

22
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,599
Madam, this is your room.

23
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,000
Open the door.

24
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:53,719
After you.

25
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:16,400
Remove all the bedsheets in there.

26
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,879
No, wait...

27
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:18,599
These were all...

28
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:20,120
specially prepared for your arrival,

29
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,080
bought just for you!

30
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,879
They're all new! No need to change them!

31
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:25,599
My lady's bedding...

32
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,599
must strictly use fibers...

33
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:28,479
exceeding 31.8 millimeters...

34
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:29,800
of Egyptian long-staple cotton.

35
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:34,439
We really don't have that in stock.

36
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,439
But rest assured,

37
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:37,680
we will definitely accommodate you.

38
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,759
I'll send someone to buy it right away.

39
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,560
No problem at all.

40
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:43,240
Now, ma'am, do you have any other requests?

41
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,280
For security reasons,

42
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:47,039
you must clear out all the guest rooms...

43
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:48,159
on this entire floor.

44
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,560
Clear... clear them out?

45
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,120
You only have four people in your party.

46
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,719
Is it really necessary to clear everyone out?

47
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,319
It's absolutely necessary.

48
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,879
Any losses to your hotel...

49
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,280
will be fully compensated by me.

50
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,800
That's a lot of zeros, Mr. Xiao.

51
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:22,240
No problem, don't you worry.

52
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,639
We'll definitely get it all done.

53
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:24,920
Clear it out, clear it out. Clear everything out.

54
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,720
Exactly as you requested.

55
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,639
So please get some good rest, everyone.

56
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,439
We won't disturb you any longer.

57
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,279
Let's go. Move, move, move.

58
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:43,639
She really made a bunch of petty requests.

59
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,800
Each one trivial yet complicated.

60
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,680
She's so hard to please.

61
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,160
That's your problem.

62
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:50,680
We must satisfy her every demand.

63
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,040
She's an esteemed guest of our hotel.

64
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,800
Wouldn't you say?

65
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,360
Yes, Mr. Xiao.

66
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,759
She certainly has money.

67
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,959
Of course she does.

68
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:58,079
The two of you, hurry up and

69
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,560
clear this entire floor for me.

70
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:02,199
Whatever she wants, give it to her.

71
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:02,959
Understood?

72
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:05,120
If there's anything we don't have,

73
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:06,279
have Yang Di go buy it.

74
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,800
As for security...

75
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,600
Where's Xiang Lai?

76
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:14,560
He said he had some business at Zhong'an,

77
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:15,920
and went over to take care of it first.

78
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,639
That kid.

79
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,040
He's always around when nothing's happening,

80
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,639
but vanishes the moment something comes up.

81
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,560
I'm still a bit worried.

82
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,240
Here's what we'll do.

83
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,680
Xiaoxue, call Xiang Lai.

84
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,959
Tell him to dispatch more men

85
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:29,600
to beef up security.

86
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,040
Also, be sure to keep a close eye on

87
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,279
all traffic in and out of the top floor.

88
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:33,839
Right.

89
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:34,480
Okay.

90
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:16,879
Hades.

91
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:19,199
The African Queen has checked into

92
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:20,319
the Grand Plato Hotel.

93
00:06:20,319 --> 00:06:22,199
The hotel has stepped up security,

94
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:23,800
but by Marisa's side,

95
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,360
there is no one from Zhong'an or Bito.

96
00:06:27,399 --> 00:06:29,800
They clearly don't trust security firms.

97
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,399
Given her status,

98
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,279
having only two female bodyguards...

99
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,279
That's pretty reckless.

100
00:06:36,839 --> 00:06:38,720
Bodyguards allowed at her side

101
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:41,240
are no worse than Zhong'an or Bito's.

102
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:44,439
Besides, here in Antilocaris,

103
00:06:45,079 --> 00:06:46,600
she has a trusted friend.

104
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,680
All I know is,

105
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:51,639
a lot of people want her dead.

106
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:54,120
I didn't expect Zhong'an and Bito

107
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:56,040
to join forces for the railway project.

108
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,480
I don't want to get tangled up with them.

109
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,160
I just want to execute this trade

110
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:04,959
and pocket that 500 million.

111
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:07,680
I don't know much about stocks.

112
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,800
Do you understand terrorist attacks?

113
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:12,040
Then that's enough.

114
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,560
Why do you think Xiang Pingsheng

115
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,879
came to Antilocaris

116
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:19,439
at this precise moment?

117
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,199
He will surely escort Marisa personally

118
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,519
to the Huatie base.

119
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,319
Once they arrive at the Huatie base,

120
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:27,519
construction will speed up,

121
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,000
and then their stock

122
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,399
will skyrocket.

123
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,199
Look at this.

124
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:38,000
Since Marisa arrived in Antilocaris,

125
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:39,160
the other railway companies' stocks,

126
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,639
aside from Huatie's,

127
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,680
have continued to plummet.

128
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,720
The moment trouble hits Huatie's base,

129
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,439
the stocks of those competitors

130
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,920
will rebound sharply.

131
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:49,879
I've already set up the brokerages

132
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:52,120
to churn trades when the time is right.

133
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,959
Before 4:00 p.m.,

134
00:07:53,959 --> 00:07:55,639
when the market closes,

135
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:59,279
my ten million will turn into 500 million.

136
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,399
And the terrorist attack you mentioned?

137
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:06,279
While preparing to strike the Huatie base,

138
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:08,920
pin down Marisa and Xiang Pingsheng.

139
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:12,800
Half an hour before the market closes,

140
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:15,800
leak their negative press.

141
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:19,240
Zhong'an's men can't carry guns anyway.

142
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:22,120
This will be a piece of cake.

143
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:24,079
Don't underestimate your opponents.

144
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,360
They share a common friend.

145
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,199
A common friend?

146
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,879
And an old friend of mine, Wei Tian.

147
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,039
The Silent Protectors.

148
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,480
The Silent Protectors will intervene.

149
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,799
Then we take him out first.

150
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,360
Don't be so crude.

151
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,399
We're not here to kill people.

152
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,120
We're here to make money.

153
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,679
Glorious, beautiful money.

154
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,519
Delay the Silent Protectors and Zhong'an

155
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:50,120
from leaving by six hours.

156
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:51,399
In other words,

157
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,200
buy us just six more hours,

158
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,200
and that will be enough.

159
00:08:54,559 --> 00:08:56,200
You can handle a minor task like that, no?

160
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,200
Don't worry.

161
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:59,720
For the sake of Huatie Group's stock,

162
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:01,559
I'll buy you those six hours.

163
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:09,759
Wei Tian...

164
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:12,200
We've clashed so many times,

165
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:14,639
yet I'm still so fond of you.

166
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:17,639
Women...

167
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:20,159
are always a man's weakness.

168
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,080
I'll torture you slowly

169
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:27,159
and make you wish you were dead.

170
00:09:41,519 --> 00:09:43,840
All right, see you tomorrow morning.

171
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,159
I heard that.

172
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:47,600
They've arranged to meet tomorrow.

173
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,600
They'll probably head out.

174
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,039
Then you go

175
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,279
and keep an eye on them.

176
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:16,399
That's how it is.

177
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:18,600
Flanked by bodyguards on both sides,

178
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:21,000
casually writing a check

179
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,559
for $100,000.

180
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:25,399
People like that are truly filthy rich.

181
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:27,600
Are you talking about

182
00:10:28,159 --> 00:10:29,759
our mutual client,

183
00:10:29,759 --> 00:10:30,720
Marisa?

184
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,639
Yeah.

185
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:33,679
Some of those wealthy folks

186
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:35,799
made their fortune from scratch, too.

187
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:36,919
Once they earn it,

188
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,240
how they choose to spend it

189
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,679
is their own business.

190
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,240
When you look at her,

191
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,200
does it affect

192
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,720
or change your own dreams?

193
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:46,600
It does.

194
00:10:47,039 --> 00:10:49,600
If you could live such a lavish life,

195
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:51,919
who'd want an ordinary one?

196
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:55,320
Then what's your real dream?

197
00:10:57,759 --> 00:11:00,480
Actually, my dream is quite simple.

198
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:03,559
I just want to have

199
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,039
a sense of home wherever I go.

200
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:07,440
That's why I chose Grand Plato Hotel.

201
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,879
That way, I can give every guest

202
00:11:10,039 --> 00:11:11,720
the warmth of home.

203
00:11:12,559 --> 00:11:14,159
Deep down,

204
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:16,200
everyone yearns for a home.

205
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:19,159
When they check in, they have two wishes.

206
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:21,399
One is to go back home,

207
00:11:21,879 --> 00:11:25,639
and the other is to become rich.

208
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,519
Actually, I'm the same.

209
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:31,759
Sometimes I want to be a top professional,

210
00:11:32,759 --> 00:11:33,679
but other times,

211
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,440
I just want to be like this land—

212
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:39,720
loving freedom, wild and unbound.

213
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,440
Hearing all this,

214
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,279
do you think I'm being childish?

215
00:11:48,279 --> 00:11:49,039
Not at all.

216
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,840
At your age,

217
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:54,360
it's completely normal to feel that way.

218
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:02,960
This way, please.

219
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,799
Please.

220
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,519
You're Marisa?

221
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:23,960
Yes.

222
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,080
I'm Xiang Pingsheng.

223
00:12:25,399 --> 00:12:26,200
Hello.

224
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:29,080
He's Zhong'an's local head,

225
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:29,960
Xiang Lai.

226
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,039
Hello.

227
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:32,759
Marisa, please sit.

228
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:39,360
Mr. Xiang, a pleasure to work with you.

229
00:12:39,919 --> 00:12:42,240
I've long heard Zhong'an Security Group

230
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:42,840
in Africa

231
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,679
is a renowned security firm.

232
00:12:44,679 --> 00:12:45,399
Thank you.

233
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,679
You're too kind.

234
00:12:47,559 --> 00:12:49,600
So the details of this mission are...

235
00:12:50,639 --> 00:12:51,600
Before tonight,

236
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:54,039
you'll pick up the Chinese experts

237
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,440
and take them to the Grand Plato Hotel.

238
00:12:55,639 --> 00:12:56,480
Tomorrow morning,

239
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,600
we'll escort them to the building site.

240
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,559
Simple as that.

241
00:13:02,919 --> 00:13:03,960
Simple as that.

242
00:13:07,399 --> 00:13:09,240
If the mission is that simple,

243
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,000
why do we need the Silent Protectors

244
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,320
to work with us?

245
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:14,399
They're here to protect me.

246
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:17,279
Am I to understand

247
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:19,759
that you don't trust

248
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,960
Zhong'an's capabilities?

249
00:13:22,919 --> 00:13:24,240
I need Wei Tian more.

250
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,320
Around here,

251
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:29,399
the name Marisa might mean nothing,

252
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:31,480
but mention the African Queen,

253
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,200
and everyone knows who you are.

254
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,799
I'm just curious.

255
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,519
With so much influence,

256
00:13:38,159 --> 00:13:39,159
why do you still...

257
00:13:39,759 --> 00:13:41,799
why do you need the Silent Protectors?

258
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:45,480
When people spoke of the African Queen,

259
00:13:45,799 --> 00:13:47,320
they only knew she was a woman,

260
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:49,759
a mysterious figure.

261
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,000
But now,

262
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:53,080
someone leaked my photo.

263
00:13:53,559 --> 00:13:56,039
Plenty of enemies want my head.

264
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,320
Then you could easily lie low,

265
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,000
keep out of sight.

266
00:14:02,639 --> 00:14:05,039
Mr. Xiang, that's not my style.

267
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,200
With all due respect,

268
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:12,039
doing this

269
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,039
with regards to your personal safety

270
00:14:14,159 --> 00:14:15,480
is utterly reckless.

271
00:14:16,639 --> 00:14:18,159
That's why I hired the Silent Protectors,

272
00:14:18,399 --> 00:14:19,720
paid top dollar,

273
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,720
and had them protect my life.

274
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,159
Mr. Xiang,

275
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,279
here's to a great partnership.

276
00:14:36,879 --> 00:14:38,039
Meeting's over?

277
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:39,600
Yes.

278
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:42,759
Short and sweet.

279
00:14:43,399 --> 00:14:44,679
Any other questions?

280
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:46,799
None.

281
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:48,919
To our partnership.

282
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,679
To our partnership.

283
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:53,720
To our partnership.

284
00:14:59,639 --> 00:15:00,840
When you see her later,

285
00:15:00,879 --> 00:15:02,679
do you want to wear a bulletproof vest?

286
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,039
No need.

287
00:15:05,559 --> 00:15:06,879
Did she say when she'll arrive?

288
00:15:07,679 --> 00:15:08,480
No.

289
00:15:09,159 --> 00:15:10,080
No way.

290
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,679
Is that Marisa really coming?

291
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:13,840
She's terrifying. I don't want to see her.

292
00:15:14,399 --> 00:15:17,080
She does have... quite a personality.

293
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,600
I text her every year on her birthday.

294
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,519
Didn't forget this year either.

295
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,200
Last time she asked about dishes

296
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,720
and how to cook the recipes,

297
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,320
didn't Captain send them over to her?

298
00:15:27,919 --> 00:15:28,960
Of course.

299
00:15:29,279 --> 00:15:30,759
She's the Queen, after all.

300
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,840
If she loses her temper,

301
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,919
it's no joke.

302
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,480
I've never seen you

303
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:38,960
so afraid of someone before.

304
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,759
She is quite hot-tempered.

305
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:42,759
But I just don't get

306
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:44,320
why she didn't come straight to me

307
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,240
instead of using a middleman.

308
00:15:47,519 --> 00:15:48,320
Strange.

309
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:51,840
Anyway, we'll see when she gets here.

310
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:52,879
Let's wait.

311
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,240
Marisa...

312
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,440
It reminds me of our days in the Deep Sea,

313
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,279
working as international mercenaries.

314
00:16:34,799 --> 00:16:37,000
Can't bear to toss that beat-up camera?

315
00:16:37,519 --> 00:16:38,440
When I get old,

316
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,600
looking at these will remind me of you.

317
00:16:40,879 --> 00:16:41,879
Wouldn't that be nice?

318
00:16:42,519 --> 00:16:43,519
In your eyes,

319
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:45,720
all you see are fond memories.

320
00:16:49,039 --> 00:16:51,480
All I see is regret.

321
00:16:52,519 --> 00:16:53,759
Marisa on the battlefield...

322
00:16:54,399 --> 00:16:56,159
isn't someone just anyone can handle.

323
00:17:29,319 --> 00:17:30,640
Hades, shift change.

324
00:17:30,799 --> 00:17:32,119
We can't stay here too long.

325
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,160
We head out in three hours.

326
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,279
Go grab something to eat.

327
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:36,160
Get some rest.

328
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:38,799
Once we cross the woods at the city limit,

329
00:17:39,039 --> 00:17:40,759
we'll enter Antilocaris.

330
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,359
To keep fighting there.

331
00:17:43,079 --> 00:17:44,640
Our mission is to protect the king.

332
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,920
But this country's king...

333
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:47,119
...is just a figurehead.

334
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,319
The military truly controls the country.

335
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:51,200
Our purpose in infiltrating here...

336
00:17:51,319 --> 00:17:52,599
...is to protect the king...

337
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:54,799
...and avoid a direct clash with the army.

338
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,880
If something happens to the king...

339
00:17:58,880 --> 00:17:59,880
...and he goes missing,

340
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,400
what should we do?

341
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,680
Wei Tian, come take a photo with us.

342
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:06,440
Hurry, hurry!

343
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:08,279
I'll take it.

344
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:11,200
Come on.

345
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,160
Here.

346
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:16,279
Hurry, let's take a group photo together.

347
00:18:16,839 --> 00:18:17,960
Wei Tian, come on!

348
00:18:18,119 --> 00:18:19,799
Yeah, Wei Tian, get over here!

349
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:20,759
Hurry up.

350
00:18:20,759 --> 00:18:21,119
All right.

351
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:27,160
Ready...

352
00:18:28,279 --> 00:18:30,720
One, two, three!

353
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:45,279
Oh, no!

354
00:18:45,759 --> 00:18:47,039
I just remembered.

355
00:18:48,359 --> 00:18:49,240
What if...

356
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,279
Relax, will you?

357
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,880
What if she arrives,

358
00:18:52,039 --> 00:18:53,680
and immediately asks for

359
00:18:54,599 --> 00:18:55,400
chicken curry?

360
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,359
I don't have any here!

361
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,839
No way, I've got to make some.

362
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,319
Still remember she loves chicken curry.

363
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,359
The way you guys talk about her,

364
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:07,039
makes me want to meet her right away.

365
00:19:08,839 --> 00:19:09,640
Wei Tian!

366
00:19:13,599 --> 00:19:14,400
Marisa!

367
00:19:20,559 --> 00:19:21,519
Long time no see.

368
00:19:21,759 --> 00:19:22,559
Yeah.

369
00:19:23,319 --> 00:19:24,240
Look at Shalan.

370
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:26,880
Sister Marisa!

371
00:19:27,319 --> 00:19:28,119
Shalan!

372
00:19:28,759 --> 00:19:29,880
It's been so many years,

373
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,880
and you've grown even more gorgeous.

374
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,319
Oh, stop it!

375
00:19:34,079 --> 00:19:36,519
I only brought a gift for you this time.

376
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:40,880
See? That's businesspeople for you.

377
00:19:41,039 --> 00:19:42,119
She knows how to make money.

378
00:19:42,119 --> 00:19:43,880
And keeps making more and more.

379
00:19:49,319 --> 00:19:50,359
A diamond necklace!

380
00:19:51,759 --> 00:19:52,680
What about me?

381
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,599
I've slaved away for you for so long,

382
00:19:54,599 --> 00:19:56,279
why haven't you rewarded me like this?

383
00:19:57,839 --> 00:19:59,720
Sister Marisa is the best! Thank you!

384
00:19:59,759 --> 00:20:01,319
Then why not come work for me?

385
00:20:01,559 --> 00:20:04,200
High pay, easy work, and zero danger.

386
00:20:04,359 --> 00:20:05,119
Every day you get to see

387
00:20:05,119 --> 00:20:06,680
shiny things like this.

388
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,279
We'll talk about that later.

389
00:20:12,279 --> 00:20:13,599
Let me take you to Uncle Qu first.

390
00:20:13,839 --> 00:20:14,599
He made you

391
00:20:14,599 --> 00:20:16,119
your favorite chicken curry.

392
00:20:16,279 --> 00:20:17,519
You're so lucky.

393
00:20:18,599 --> 00:20:20,440
She isn't as scary as you all said.

394
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:22,920
That's only because

395
00:20:23,319 --> 00:20:24,759
you don't really know her yet.

396
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:37,960
Good wine.

397
00:20:42,319 --> 00:20:44,960
Just be honest with me.

398
00:20:45,599 --> 00:20:47,799
Why do you need me to protect you?

399
00:20:48,359 --> 00:20:49,519
Because I trust you.

400
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,359
You don't need protection at all.

401
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,720
The Chinese railway construction section

402
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,200
and the areas it passes through...

403
00:20:59,599 --> 00:21:01,200
Some issues have popped up there lately.

404
00:21:01,599 --> 00:21:03,319
I need to go handle and resolve them.

405
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:08,480
You're an iron woman.

406
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,880
Wealthy and capable.

407
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:13,640
No problem could ever stop you.

408
00:21:14,359 --> 00:21:15,559
It's different this time.

409
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:17,599
My former head of security

410
00:21:17,599 --> 00:21:19,160
occupied that land with his men.

411
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,839
The series of sabotage

412
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:21,839
against Huatie Group...

413
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:23,319
They're all aimed at me.

414
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:27,880
My trouble is a minor issue.

415
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:30,119
Building this railway is what matters.

416
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,039
Building this railway

417
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:34,440
means crossing heavily contested areas.

418
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:36,119
Even the slightest issue

419
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:38,119
could cause tremendous risks.

420
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,799
The opening of this railway

421
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:40,599
can drive

422
00:21:40,599 --> 00:21:42,519
growth of surrounding tribes and cities,

423
00:21:43,119 --> 00:21:46,039
lifting locals from poverty and hunger.

424
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,680
It's something I've been striving to do,

425
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:49,480
but have never managed to achieve.

426
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,400
So no matter what,

427
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,519
I must ensure the railway opens smoothly,

428
00:21:54,039 --> 00:21:57,319
leading them from barbarism to peace.

429
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:02,839
Why not turn to Zhong'an?

430
00:22:04,079 --> 00:22:06,160
I've already met with

431
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,079
Xiang Pingsheng, the head of Zhong'an,

432
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:09,200
and received his security plan.

433
00:22:10,039 --> 00:22:10,839
After all,

434
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:13,480
Zhong'an is new to operating in Africa.

435
00:22:13,839 --> 00:22:14,920
With cultural differences,

436
00:22:15,119 --> 00:22:16,599
conflicts are inevitable.

437
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,599
Besides, what you'll be facing

438
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:20,200
is my former security detail.

439
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:23,079
I trained them myself.

440
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:27,799
I get it.

441
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:31,720
You don't want Zhong'an in too deep.

442
00:22:31,839 --> 00:22:34,279
You want me to help clean house, right?

443
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:37,000
That's why I want you to work together.

444
00:22:39,559 --> 00:22:40,400
No problem.

445
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:44,440
How many people from China this time?

446
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:45,519
Four.

447
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:48,319
Two officials and two technicians.

448
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:50,920
Zhong'an will protect the four of them.

449
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:53,279
You will protect me.

450
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:55,200
All right.

451
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:57,160
Thank you.

452
00:23:04,039 --> 00:23:04,559
Wei Tian.

453
00:23:07,359 --> 00:23:09,000
Are you sure you know Marisa that well?

454
00:23:10,119 --> 00:23:11,160
What's the problem?

455
00:23:12,279 --> 00:23:13,079
I'm worried she'll

456
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,359
use you guys as a mobile human shield.

457
00:23:15,559 --> 00:23:17,519
You should weigh the security risks.

458
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:21,839
Honestly, if everyone partnered with Bito,

459
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,119
it would be much safer.

460
00:23:24,319 --> 00:23:25,160
Don't worry.

461
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,960
Zhong'an will soon partner with Bito

462
00:23:28,039 --> 00:23:29,559
to jointly protect Huatie Group.

463
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:30,880
Good.

464
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:12,960
My room doesn't need surveillance.

465
00:24:13,359 --> 00:24:14,640
Having you is enough.

466
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:18,039
Surveillance is a must.

467
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,000
Don't worry, though.

468
00:24:20,279 --> 00:24:21,920
It won't invade your privacy.

469
00:24:22,039 --> 00:24:23,240
I've already arranged it.

470
00:24:23,359 --> 00:24:24,319
You don't need to worry.

471
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:32,240
What's the plan for the four delegates?

472
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,279
It's taken care of.

473
00:24:33,519 --> 00:24:35,559
Xiang Lai will bring them to the hotel.

474
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,559
What if there's a sniper?

475
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,400
What do I do then?

476
00:24:50,599 --> 00:24:52,640
With our Captain here, you can rest easy.

477
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:02,759
Captain, what's the situation?

478
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:18,359
If it were me, I'd pick right here.

479
00:25:19,160 --> 00:25:20,440
Seven o'clock, right?

480
00:25:21,599 --> 00:25:22,400
Exactly.

481
00:25:25,119 --> 00:25:25,759
See it?

482
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,839
Madam Marisa and Mr. Wei Tian

483
00:26:01,839 --> 00:26:02,839
don't want to be disturbed.

484
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:05,000
No, I have something for them.

485
00:26:06,119 --> 00:26:08,400
Leave the stuff, but you can't go in.

486
00:26:14,119 --> 00:26:15,480
He's always acting so

487
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,720
cold and aloof toward me,

488
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:18,400
and now he's being so thoughtful?

489
00:26:18,759 --> 00:26:19,720
What a chameleon.

490
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,960
Shalan, um...

491
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:39,240
Are you looking for Madam Marisa?

492
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,519
Yeah.

493
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:42,440
She's not in her room. She's swimming.

494
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:43,960
In that case,

495
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:45,079
I'll come back later.

496
00:26:45,079 --> 00:26:46,559
Wait, hold on, um...

497
00:26:47,319 --> 00:26:49,079
I have a question for you.

498
00:26:49,519 --> 00:26:50,319
Go ahead.

499
00:26:52,759 --> 00:26:53,599
Madam Marisa...

500
00:26:53,599 --> 00:26:55,839
Why insist on Wei Tian protecting her?

501
00:26:56,079 --> 00:26:57,759
They've known each other for a long time.

502
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:00,720
How did they meet?

503
00:27:01,519 --> 00:27:03,559
I don't know either. I'm taking off.

504
00:27:03,559 --> 00:27:04,759
Wait, um...

505
00:27:05,720 --> 00:27:08,079
Did Wei Tian mention how they met?

506
00:27:08,079 --> 00:27:09,039
Or, um...

507
00:27:09,039 --> 00:27:11,039
What does Marisa's husband do?

508
00:27:11,599 --> 00:27:13,720
Sorry, I really have no idea.

509
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:22,039
They have such great chemistry.

510
00:27:22,039 --> 00:27:25,160
They must be more than just acquaintances.

511
00:27:26,599 --> 00:27:27,480
As you know,

512
00:27:27,839 --> 00:27:29,920
I met Wei Tian after losing my memory.

513
00:27:30,119 --> 00:27:32,680
I'm not really sure how he was before.

514
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:35,119
Though Marisa...

515
00:27:35,400 --> 00:27:37,200
is indeed quite a charming woman.

516
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:43,480
Don't take it the wrong way.

517
00:27:52,759 --> 00:27:53,559
Uncle Qu...

518
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,960
Don't ask me about Wei Tian.

519
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:57,839
I...

520
00:27:57,839 --> 00:27:58,960
Even if you ask, I wouldn't know.

521
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:02,519
I haven't even spoken and you're nervous.

522
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,839
Why did you drag me over here, anyway?

523
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:13,000
If you really distrust Wei Tian that much,

524
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:14,920
you can just go and ask him directly.

525
00:28:15,079 --> 00:28:16,319
Why do this?

526
00:28:17,119 --> 00:28:19,319
I'm just delivering dessert.

527
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:24,279
I'm knocking.

528
00:28:25,519 --> 00:28:26,319
Go ahead.

529
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,559
I'm really gonna knock!

530
00:28:30,119 --> 00:28:31,240
Let me do it, let me do it!

531
00:28:49,079 --> 00:28:49,880
Wei Tian.

532
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,960
Wei Tian, bring me a bath towel.

533
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:55,200
Sure.

534
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:37,079
What's wrong? Are you okay?

535
00:29:38,039 --> 00:29:38,920
I'm fine.

536
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:45,200
Get some rest.

537
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,319
As scheduled,

538
00:29:58,359 --> 00:30:00,160
the restaurant has been booked.

539
00:30:00,599 --> 00:30:02,960
The Chinese personnel are in position.

540
00:30:03,519 --> 00:30:06,400
All right. I'll change and head right over.

541
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:17,759
Move out.

542
00:30:26,519 --> 00:30:28,200
It looks delightful.

543
00:30:29,799 --> 00:30:30,599
It was all thanks to Mr. Wei,

544
00:30:30,599 --> 00:30:32,200
who told me your preferences in advance.

545
00:30:32,319 --> 00:30:33,839
That's how I could cater to your taste.

546
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:37,359
Anticipating a guest's wishes

547
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:40,440
and tailoring dishes to their liking...

548
00:30:41,519 --> 00:30:43,400
You're quite a thoughtful man.

549
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:44,200
Thank you.

550
00:30:44,279 --> 00:30:46,759
It's an honor to earn your praise.

551
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,240
Be careful, though.

552
00:30:52,519 --> 00:30:54,240
Chefs fall in love very easily

553
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,599
with anyone who praises their food.

554
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:58,440
And the price is hurting your hands,

555
00:30:58,599 --> 00:30:59,839
making it hard to ever cook again.

556
00:31:02,599 --> 00:31:04,799
Um, I still have dessert in the back.

557
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:05,599
I'll go get it for you.

558
00:31:09,680 --> 00:31:11,079
Why frighten him?

559
00:31:11,359 --> 00:31:12,720
It's not like I'd eat him alive.

560
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:14,279
I know.

561
00:31:14,519 --> 00:31:15,880
But I know what your appetite is like.

562
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,759
Why didn't you shoot?

563
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:58,759
Zhong'an can't use guns here.

564
00:31:58,759 --> 00:32:00,720
Since Marisa is safe now,

565
00:32:00,839 --> 00:32:02,400
there's no need to kill them.

566
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:04,240
When did you get so soft-hearted?

567
00:32:04,279 --> 00:32:05,880
I've always been this way.

568
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:09,000
Then you take it.

569
00:32:10,960 --> 00:32:12,039
I don't need a gun.

570
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:13,440
It's yours.

571
00:32:13,640 --> 00:32:14,440
I don't want it.

572
00:32:14,720 --> 00:32:15,519
I'll take it.

573
00:32:16,359 --> 00:32:18,119
It's a nice gun. Keep it.

574
00:32:19,599 --> 00:32:21,440
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

575
00:32:21,559 --> 00:32:22,400
Are you all right?

576
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:23,160
I'm fine.

577
00:32:24,319 --> 00:32:26,119
Madame Marisa, are you all right?

578
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:28,240
Just shaken up.

579
00:32:29,359 --> 00:32:30,160
A bit dizzy.

580
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:34,359
Wei Tian, walk me back to my room.

581
00:32:34,359 --> 00:32:35,000
Mr. Xiang.

582
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:36,599
Stop playing around.

583
00:32:38,440 --> 00:32:39,680
That girl likes you.

584
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,480
Mr... Mr. Xiang.

585
00:32:44,119 --> 00:32:45,240
You can't leave.

586
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,440
Why?

587
00:32:47,279 --> 00:32:48,920
We still need you here.

588
00:32:51,519 --> 00:32:53,519
They used this equipment

589
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:54,839
to eavesdrop on you.

590
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:56,680
Only, when coming and going,

591
00:32:56,920 --> 00:32:58,240
they avoided the cameras,

592
00:32:58,240 --> 00:33:00,240
so no clear facial footage was captured.

593
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,680
The guest living below Marisa

594
00:33:04,119 --> 00:33:05,240
at the front desk

595
00:33:05,279 --> 00:33:07,160
registered under a fake name.

596
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:10,640
The staff member we hired recently

597
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:11,920
also used an alias.

598
00:33:14,079 --> 00:33:16,759
I've seen that man's tattoo before.

599
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:18,880
A tattoo?

600
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:20,960
Where on his body?

601
00:33:22,519 --> 00:33:23,440
On his right wrist.

602
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,319
Go on.

603
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:32,079
They're a local cult organization

604
00:33:32,279 --> 00:33:33,599
dealing in drugs,

605
00:33:33,599 --> 00:33:35,880
human trafficking, and organ trade.

606
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:38,119
Later, Hades took control of them.

607
00:33:38,119 --> 00:33:39,440
In the area where I live,

608
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:41,400
I mainly focus on growing crops,

609
00:33:41,519 --> 00:33:42,640
developing handicrafts,

610
00:33:42,720 --> 00:33:44,160
and some mineral extraction.

611
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:46,119
As my influence expanded,

612
00:33:46,279 --> 00:33:48,640
surrounding tribes joined in one by one.

613
00:33:49,799 --> 00:33:50,839
Especially with my role as advisor

614
00:33:50,839 --> 00:33:52,039
for the Chinese railway construction,

615
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:54,279
which has brought this country and region

616
00:33:54,279 --> 00:33:55,680
immense development.

617
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:56,720
Yet this cult organization

618
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,680
hates the progress technology brings.

619
00:33:59,000 --> 00:33:59,799
That's why

620
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,799
these people want to kill me.

621
00:34:07,039 --> 00:34:09,800
I've heard of this cult too.

622
00:34:10,239 --> 00:34:13,079
They grow drugs to buy weapons,

623
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:16,719
but they've never done assassinations.

624
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:20,000
Someone must be colluding with them.

625
00:34:21,239 --> 00:34:22,039
Xiang Lai,

626
00:34:23,039 --> 00:34:24,000
you need to dispatch men

627
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:26,719
to protect our VIP around the clock.

628
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:28,920
Nothing can go wrong.

629
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:30,280
Understood.

630
00:34:36,639 --> 00:34:38,280
The complexity of the situation

631
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:40,159
has already exceeded our expectations.

632
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:43,159
Judging by those two men today,

633
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,679
their hit method and tattoos,

634
00:34:44,719 --> 00:34:46,840
they were likely sent by Hades.

635
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,280
My assessment is

636
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:50,039
an even larger foreign force

637
00:34:50,079 --> 00:34:52,039
wants to sabotage Huatie's project.

638
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:55,559
This will be a huge challenge.

639
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:57,880
It's a challenge we face together.

640
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:59,199
Right now, our primary goal

641
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:01,159
is to keep Marisa safe.

642
00:35:02,679 --> 00:35:03,639
Marisa and I

643
00:35:05,639 --> 00:35:06,840
go back a long way.

644
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:09,400
We took different paths in life.

645
00:35:10,719 --> 00:35:12,000
She's in business now.

646
00:35:15,039 --> 00:35:17,360
I'll do everything I can to protect her.

647
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:19,920
There's nothing to fear.

648
00:35:21,119 --> 00:35:23,840
Since you came to Antilocaris anyway,

649
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:25,679
honestly,

650
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:29,559
there's something I've wanted to tell you.

651
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:37,480
Zhong'an Security Group welcomes you.

652
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:42,920
If a girl

653
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:45,880
casually takes another guy's arm

654
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:47,480
and leans on his shoulder,

655
00:35:47,480 --> 00:35:48,760
claiming they're just friends,

656
00:35:49,079 --> 00:35:50,079
would you believe it?

657
00:35:50,199 --> 00:35:52,239
No way. They can't just be friends.

658
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:54,119
There's definitely something going on.

659
00:35:56,320 --> 00:35:57,039
Listen to me,

660
00:35:57,039 --> 00:35:58,000
I can't stand seeing you down like this.

661
00:35:58,000 --> 00:35:59,280
Come on, let me buy you a drink.

662
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:09,480
Come on, Anda.

663
00:36:16,159 --> 00:36:16,920
Tell me,

664
00:36:19,559 --> 00:36:21,960
can exes really stay friends?

665
00:36:22,960 --> 00:36:23,760
Do you know

666
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:27,159
how mature people handle a breakup?

667
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:28,800
They don't stay friends,

668
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:32,039
nor do they become enemies.

669
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:34,360
They just live their own lives.

670
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:36,280
Well said!

671
00:36:36,519 --> 00:36:37,320
That's what I've been saying.

672
00:36:37,639 --> 00:36:41,679
Wei Tian doesn't understand women at all.

673
00:36:41,679 --> 00:36:42,679
He has no idea

674
00:36:43,079 --> 00:36:44,920
who's genuinely good to him

675
00:36:44,920 --> 00:36:47,079
and who's just leading him on.

676
00:36:47,079 --> 00:36:48,119
Wei Tian?

677
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:49,320
No way.

678
00:36:49,360 --> 00:36:51,079
Wei Tian is definitely not like that.

679
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:52,400
With women—

680
00:36:52,559 --> 00:36:54,400
no, even with men—

681
00:36:54,719 --> 00:36:57,559
he keeps everyone at arm's length.

682
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:58,679
No way.

683
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:00,400
Like I said,

684
00:37:01,559 --> 00:37:04,039
the women who get close to him...

685
00:37:04,039 --> 00:37:05,599
something's definitely up.

686
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:07,400
It's no act.

687
00:37:08,079 --> 00:37:10,639
Well, I wouldn't jump to conclusions.

688
00:37:10,840 --> 00:37:11,920
Come on, drink up, drink!

689
00:37:11,920 --> 00:37:13,000
I'm telling you, it is.

690
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:14,800
Cheers!

691
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:21,320
The signing ceremony officially begins.

692
00:37:26,039 --> 00:37:26,360
Welcome, everyone.

693
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:30,519
Before we sign,

694
00:37:31,159 --> 00:37:32,599
I would first like to thank

695
00:37:33,079 --> 00:37:35,280
all our friends from Antilocaris

696
00:37:35,639 --> 00:37:37,840
for joining our signing ceremony today.

697
00:37:38,159 --> 00:37:39,760
We, Bito Security Group,

698
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:42,280
and Zhong'an Security Group

699
00:37:42,559 --> 00:37:45,079
have officially formed a partnership.

700
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:47,079
Zhong'an Security Group,

701
00:37:47,599 --> 00:37:49,800
since the Belt and Road Initiative began

702
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,199
five years ago,

703
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:53,199
has achieved a monumental leap forward.

704
00:37:53,559 --> 00:37:56,000
Alongside many Chinese enterprises,

705
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:58,079
we have set up operations in Antilocaris.

706
00:37:59,119 --> 00:38:00,079
The Belt and Road

707
00:38:00,079 --> 00:38:01,599
is a journey of mutual benefit.

708
00:38:02,079 --> 00:38:03,480
Zhong'an Security Group's partnership

709
00:38:03,480 --> 00:38:05,400
with Bito Security Group

710
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:09,559
will surely yield win-win results.

711
00:38:14,599 --> 00:38:15,760
We can proudly call ourselves

712
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:18,159
the New Silk Road's

713
00:38:18,679 --> 00:38:19,880
Premier Security Escort.

714
00:38:20,159 --> 00:38:20,960
That's right!

715
00:38:21,559 --> 00:38:23,440
We stand ready to dedicate our lives

716
00:38:23,519 --> 00:38:24,599
and our devotion

717
00:38:24,599 --> 00:38:26,480
to safeguard you all.

718
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:28,119
Hear, hear! Wonderful!

719
00:38:30,679 --> 00:38:31,079
Please.

720
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:43,159
Come on.

721
00:38:59,800 --> 00:39:01,960
Look, all the dishes are served.

722
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:03,159
It's all Chinese food.

723
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,559
Wei Tian, you know...

724
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:08,960
I only like Western food.

725
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:10,639
By the way, Kwame,

726
00:39:11,079 --> 00:39:12,320
this meal is my treat.

727
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:14,800
First,

728
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:16,880
to celebrate our partnership.

729
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:17,440
Second,

730
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:19,039
I'd like to treat you to

731
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:20,800
authentic Chinese cuisine.

732
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:22,760
And third,

733
00:39:23,400 --> 00:39:26,639
to thank Wei Tian for bringing us together

734
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:30,079
and give him a long-overdue taste of home.

735
00:39:30,599 --> 00:39:34,800
Mr. Kwame never touches Chinese food,

736
00:39:35,079 --> 00:39:37,880
but there are so many dishes today.

737
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:40,159
With such a spread, you should try some.

738
00:39:43,599 --> 00:39:44,719
In the past,

739
00:39:45,599 --> 00:39:47,880
I could eat a whole portion of raw beef.

740
00:39:48,639 --> 00:39:49,760
It seems today,

741
00:39:50,519 --> 00:39:52,440
I must share with you

742
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:55,719
this Chinese food that isn't to my taste.

743
00:39:59,719 --> 00:40:00,480
Mr. Xiang

744
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:03,559
asked me about your preferences long ago.

745
00:40:06,559 --> 00:40:08,239
Half a portion of raw beef?

746
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:11,480
I always eat a whole portion.

747
00:40:12,199 --> 00:40:13,079
Mr. Kwame,

748
00:40:13,159 --> 00:40:15,000
no one's going to take your raw beef.

749
00:40:15,519 --> 00:40:17,840
I only ordered half a portion

750
00:40:18,719 --> 00:40:20,440
so you'd save room

751
00:40:20,519 --> 00:40:23,400
to sample our Chinese food at leisure.

752
00:40:24,559 --> 00:40:25,519
Mr. Kwame,

753
00:40:26,199 --> 00:40:28,760
Mr. Xiang is a man of his word.

754
00:40:29,119 --> 00:40:31,760
He will never steal your business.

755
00:40:36,320 --> 00:40:36,880
All right.

756
00:40:38,159 --> 00:40:40,000
Here, let me toast you.

757
00:40:40,920 --> 00:40:41,440
Wei Tian.

758
00:40:45,880 --> 00:40:46,199
Cheers.

759
00:40:46,719 --> 00:40:47,039
Cheers.

760
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:04,400
Look here.

761
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,239
According to the blueprints,

762
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:08,000
one, two, three, four.

763
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:09,480
As for the specific construction,

764
00:41:09,719 --> 00:41:11,039
you must plan thoroughly.

765
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:11,840
Understood.

766
00:41:12,239 --> 00:41:14,440
The infrastructure extends from here,

767
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:16,440
going all the way forward.

768
00:41:16,719 --> 00:41:18,480
Strictly adhere to the blueprints.

769
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,119
Got it?

770
00:41:19,119 --> 00:41:19,760
No problem.

771
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:21,079
So during this operation,

772
00:41:21,079 --> 00:41:22,840
we must watch out for four forces.

773
00:41:23,159 --> 00:41:23,960
First,

774
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:26,079
indigenous tribes in remote mountains.

775
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:26,800
Second,

776
00:41:27,559 --> 00:41:28,800
the terrorists.

777
00:41:29,039 --> 00:41:29,840
Third,

778
00:41:30,199 --> 00:41:31,679
the rogue theft rings.

779
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:32,679
Fourth,

780
00:41:33,079 --> 00:41:35,119
traitorous guards who turned on Marisa.

781
00:41:35,559 --> 00:41:36,559
Tribal forces

782
00:41:36,599 --> 00:41:39,079
are a powerful presence in Africa.

783
00:41:39,159 --> 00:41:40,519
Over their territories,

784
00:41:40,519 --> 00:41:42,159
they hold considerable jurisdiction.

785
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:46,320
We must communicate well with them.

786
00:41:47,840 --> 00:41:49,719
As for the terrorists,

787
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,159
there is currently no

788
00:41:52,639 --> 00:41:53,800
sign of them infiltrating

789
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:55,519
Antilocaris.

790
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:58,199
Still, we must remain on guard.

791
00:41:58,519 --> 00:42:01,079
Because once the railway is completed,

792
00:42:01,079 --> 00:42:04,480
the government's prestige and influence

793
00:42:04,519 --> 00:42:06,119
will increase significantly.

794
00:42:06,639 --> 00:42:08,760
They would hate to see that happen.

795
00:42:09,519 --> 00:42:12,599
As for dealing with the theft rings,

796
00:42:13,199 --> 00:42:15,440
our on-site security will be sufficient.

797
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:19,719
Finally, there are the traitorous guards.

798
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:20,679
We must at all times

799
00:42:20,679 --> 00:42:22,679
stay highly vigilant against them.

800
00:42:23,559 --> 00:42:25,159
First, they're well-trained.

801
00:42:25,639 --> 00:42:28,280
Second, they know our situation very well.

802
00:42:29,280 --> 00:42:31,639
Although their target is Marisa,

803
00:42:31,639 --> 00:42:32,400
however,

804
00:42:32,639 --> 00:42:35,400
they might still target our VIPs

805
00:42:35,639 --> 00:42:38,360
to sabotage the railway's completion.

806
00:42:38,920 --> 00:42:39,719
Next,

807
00:42:40,199 --> 00:42:43,119
Xiang Lai will brief you on deployment.

808
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:45,480
Actually, the top priority

809
00:42:45,679 --> 00:42:47,199
is still the four engineers.

810
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:49,960
En route between the hotel and the site,

811
00:42:50,159 --> 00:42:52,400
as well as during their work on site,

812
00:42:52,519 --> 00:42:54,800
we may need colleagues from Bito Group

813
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:56,599
to provide armed perimeter security.

814
00:42:56,599 --> 00:42:57,880
That won't be a problem.

815
00:42:58,559 --> 00:43:01,000
We're partners now.

816
00:43:01,360 --> 00:43:02,960
We'll treat Zhong'an's mission

817
00:43:02,960 --> 00:43:04,960
as our own.

818
00:43:07,039 --> 00:43:07,559
Thank you.

819
00:43:08,719 --> 00:43:09,599
But what if the VIPs

820
00:43:09,599 --> 00:43:11,039
refuse to cooperate with us?

821
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:13,360
Don't worry about that.

822
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:15,840
The four engineers are highly skilled

823
00:43:15,840 --> 00:43:17,480
of the highest caliber.

824
00:43:17,480 --> 00:43:19,039
They'll understand our work.
